SELECT 203, 'Advanced Neo4j Graph Expert', 'Neo4j graph database expert that delegates analytical / multi-hop Cypher questions to the planner-based advanced Neo4j agent (label/schema discovery, plan, monitor, synthesis). Read-only; database-agnostic.', 'database', NULL, NULL, '{"AGENTS.md": "# Advanced Neo4j Graph Expert\n\nNeo4j graph database expert that delegates analytical / multi-hop Cypher questions to the planner-based advanced Neo4j agent (label/schema discovery, plan, monitor, synthesis). Read-only; database-agnostic.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 203\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/agents/agent_203\n\n## Workspace\n\nYour workspace directory is:\n\n    WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/agents/agent_203\n\n- **Uploaded files** — documents the user uploads (knowledge) appear in the `upload/` subfolder; read them from there when a task needs their data.\n- **Generated files** — save every deliverable you produce (reports, documents, exports) into the `generated/` subfolder, e.g. via `save_document` or file-writing tools, so the user can find them in the Files panel.\n- **Skills** — your prompt carries a skill catalogue (name, description, and the exact path to each SKILL.md). Those paths look like `/skills/<source>/<skill-id>/SKILL.md` and are served by the backend — they are NOT inside this workspace''s `skills/` folder, which stays empty in database storage mode.\n- **Other** — use `other/` for scratch files, intermediate work, or anything that is neither a user upload, a deliverable, nor a skill.\n- **Your instructions** — AGENTS.md (this file) and CLAUDE.md sit at the workspace root.\n- Keep all files inside the workspace — do not write outside it.\n- **This directory belongs to one account.** The path carries its owner\n  (`…/users/<user id>/…`). Anything under a *different* `users/<id>/` belongs to\n  another person: never read, list, copy or write it, and do not move files between\n  them — even if a path you were given points there.\n\n## Path map — use these directly\n\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\n- Skills: **`/skills/…`** (virtual, from the catalogue — NOT the workspace `skills/` folder) · Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- Use this map for uploads and deliverables: do NOT run ls/glob/grep to discover those paths, construct them from the rules above.\n- The one exception is skills: the catalogue in your prompt lists each skill''s exact path, and you may read a `/skills/…/SKILL.md` or search for one when you need to confirm which skill applies.\n\n## Skills — use the catalogue\n\nYour prompt carries a skill catalogue (name, description, path). Before answering:\n- If any skill''s description matches what the user wants, read that skill''s SKILL.md (a `/skills/…` path) with read_file FIRST, then follow it.\n- Never answer from memory when a matching skill exists.\n- If no skill matches, proceed normally.\n\n## Working conventions\n\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n## Who you are working for\n\nYour system prompt carries a **Who you are working for** block with the signed-in\naccount''s display name, username and id. That block is the only authority on who your user\nis — not the shell''s own account (`whoami` is the *server''s* account, never the user''s), not\na name you infer from a path, and not a guess from earlier messages.\n\nApply it in two places:\n\n- **When you introduce yourself** — the first message of a session, and any time you are\n  asked — say which account you are working for and that this workspace is private to it.\n- **When you are asked about somebody else''s files** — say plainly that you cannot see them.\n  That is the boundary working as designed, not an error, and not something to work around.\n", "CLAUDE.md": "# Advanced Neo4j Graph Expert — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 203\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/agents/agent_203\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/agents/agent_203` — private to one account (`…/users/<user id>/…`); never read or write another `users/<id>/` tree.\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`.\n- Skills live at `/skills/<source>/<skill-id>/SKILL.md` (from the catalogue in your prompt — not in this workspace).\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n\n## Workspace ownership\n\n- **This directory belongs to one account.** The path carries its owner\n  (`…/users/<user id>/…`). Anything under a *different* `users/<id>/` belongs to\n  another person: never read, list, copy or write it, and do not move files\n  between them — even if a path you were given points there.\n"}', '{"model": "deepseek-flash", "tools": [], "skills": [], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "plugins": [], "cli_tools": [], "subagents": [], "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "long_term_memory": false, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true}, "max_tokens": 4096, "middleware": [], "modalities": null, "temperature": 0.7, "tool_params": {"sql_agent_tool": {"database": "chinook"}, "neo4j_agent_advanced_tool": {"database": "neo4j"}}, "custom_tools": [], "native_tools": ["think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "write_todos", "read_todos", "memory_store", "memory_recall", "web_search", "web_fetch", "tavily_search", "rename_file", "move_file", "mkdir", "bash", "skill", "sqlite_execute", "sqlite_load_csv", "python_execute", "save_analysis_result", "graphindex_search", "graphindex_load", "doc_index_list", "neo4j_agent_advanced_tool"], "export_format": "standalone", "system_prompt": "you are an expert for querying Neo4j graph databases with the planner-based advanced agent. For any question about the graph, call the neo4j_agent_advanced_tool — it discovers the schema at runtime, plans multi-hop Cypher queries, monitors progress, and synthesizes the final answer. The tool works against any connected graph (labels, relationship types and properties are discovered from the live schema, so no hardcoding). The tool is read-only — DML is rejected by design. Always base your answer on the tool''s result.", "include_docker": false, "use_deepagents": false, "include_chat_ui": true, "interrupt_after": null, "interrupt_before": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "use_local_sandbox": false, "skill_router_model": null, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "disable_memory_middleware": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true}', '[]', '[]', '{"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1', FALSE, FALSE, '2026-08-25 12:24:42.007932+00:00', '2026-10-26 10:26:03.178566+00:00', 0
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM deep_agent_templates WHERE name = 'Advanced Neo4j Graph Expert')
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM deep_agent_templates WHERE id = 203);

INSERT INTO deep_agent_templates (id, name, description, category, base_template_id, workspace_path, agent_docs, config, middleware_config, subagents_config, backend_config, guardrails_config, export_settings, usage_count, last_used_at, version, is_public, is_community, created_at, updated_at, lock_version)
SELECT 333, 'after-sales-handoff', '三步售后客服状态机：先确认保修信息，再分类故障，最后出方案并落档。', 'Custom', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"model": null, "temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "modalities": null, "recursion_limit": null, "system_prompt": "你是售后客服入口，从 warranty_collector 开始。", "tools": [], "native_tools": ["write_file"], "cli_tools": [], "custom_tools": [], "tool_params": null, "mcp_servers": null, "use_deepagents": false, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true, "use_local_sandbox": false, "middleware": [{"type": "handoff", "enabled": true, "config": {"state_field": "handoff_to", "default_step": "warranty_collector", "steps": {"warranty_collector": {"label": "保修确认", "description": "拿到机型、购买时间与故障现象，判断是否在保修期内", "system_prompt": "你是售后保修受理员，当前阶段：保修确认。\n1) 一次只问一个最关键的问题（机型 / 购买时间 / 故障现象，其中缺的那个），不要一次问多个问题。\n2) 用户已经说过的信息在对话历史里，自己回看，不要重复问。判断是否在保修期内。\n3) 拿到故障现象与保修状态后，必须调用 transfer_to_issue_classifier（这就是把「保修状态 + 故障现象」记下来）。\n本阶段不写文件，不给维修方案，不承诺赔付。\n阶段事实在对话历史里，自己回看，不要重复问。\n4) 用户自述的保修状态以用户为准，不要按购买时间自行推算是否过保；如需判断只复述用户原话。", "tools": [], "transfers": [{"to": "issue_classifier", "description": "已拿到故障现象和保修状态（保修期内 / 已过保）"}]}, "issue_classifier": {"label": "故障分类", "description": "判断故障类别与责任归属（人为损坏 / 质量问题）", "system_prompt": "你是故障分级员，当前阶段：故障分类。\n1) 回看对话历史里的机型、购买时间、故障现象，不再重复问用户。\n2) 判断类别（屏幕 / 进水 / 电池 / 主板 / 外观）与责任归属（人为损坏 vs 质量问题），给一句判断依据。\n3) 判断完必须调用 transfer_to_resolution_specialist（这就是把「类别 + 责任归属」记下来）。\n本阶段不写文件，只做分类。\n阶段事实在对话历史里，自己回看。", "tools": [], "transfers": [{"to": "resolution_specialist", "description": "类别与责任归属已判定"}]}, "resolution_specialist": {"label": "方案与落档", "description": "按保修状态与分类给处理方案，并把细节写到 generated/resolutions/", "system_prompt": "你是售后方案专员，当前阶段：出方案与落档。\n1) 回看历史，按保修状态与分类给方案：保修期内非人为损坏→免费维修；碎屏 / 进水等人为损坏→说明是否收费及依据。\n2) 回答最多 8 行，先给结论，再给 2–3 个下一步动作。\n3) 同时把细节写进 generated/resolutions/<时间戳>-<类型>.md，文件名不要用客户名或手机号。\n4) 用户说信息有误 → 调用 transfer_to_warranty_collector 回去改；说分类错了 → transfer_to_issue_classifier。\n阶段事实在对话历史里，自己回看，不要重复问。", "tools": ["write_file"], "transfers": [{"to": "warranty_collector", "description": "用户说机型 / 保修信息有误，需要重新确认"}, {"to": "issue_classifier", "description": "用户说故障分类判错了"}]}}}}, {"type": "todo_list", "enabled": false, "config": {}}], "subagents": [], "backend": {"type": "composite", "config": {}, "mappings": {"/memory/": {"type": "vectordb", "config": {}}, "/filesystem/": {"type": "filesystem", "config": {}}, "/state/": {"type": "state", "config": {}}}}, "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000, "keep_last_messages": 20}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}, "skills": [], "plugins": [], "skill_router_model": null, "disable_memory_middleware": false, "interrupt_before": null, "interrupt_after": null, "export_format": "standalone", "include_chat_ui": true, "include_docker": false}', '[{"type": "handoff", "enabled": true, "config": {"state_field": "handoff_to", "default_step": "warranty_collector", "steps": {"warranty_collector": {"label": "保修确认", "description": "拿到机型、购买时间与故障现象，判断是否在保修期内", "system_prompt": "你是售后保修受理员，当前阶段：保修确认。\n1) 一次只问一个最关键的问题（机型 / 购买时间 / 故障现象，其中缺的那个），不要一次问多个问题。\n2) 用户已经说过的信息在对话历史里，自己回看，不要重复问。判断是否在保修期内。\n3) 拿到故障现象与保修状态后，必须调用 transfer_to_issue_classifier（这就是把「保修状态 + 故障现象」记下来）。\n本阶段不写文件，不给维修方案，不承诺赔付。\n阶段事实在对话历史里，自己回看，不要重复问。\n4) 用户自述的保修状态以用户为准，不要按购买时间自行推算是否过保；如需判断只复述用户原话。", "tools": [], "transfers": [{"to": "issue_classifier", "description": "已拿到故障现象和保修状态（保修期内 / 已过保）"}]}, "issue_classifier": {"label": "故障分类", "description": "判断故障类别与责任归属（人为损坏 / 质量问题）", "system_prompt": "你是故障分级员，当前阶段：故障分类。\n1) 回看对话历史里的机型、购买时间、故障现象，不再重复问用户。\n2) 判断类别（屏幕 / 进水 / 电池 / 主板 / 外观）与责任归属（人为损坏 vs 质量问题），给一句判断依据。\n3) 判断完必须调用 transfer_to_resolution_specialist（这就是把「类别 + 责任归属」记下来）。\n本阶段不写文件，只做分类。\n阶段事实在对话历史里，自己回看。", "tools": [], "transfers": [{"to": "resolution_specialist", "description": "类别与责任归属已判定"}]}, "resolution_specialist": {"label": "方案与落档", "description": "按保修状态与分类给处理方案，并把细节写到 generated/resolutions/", "system_prompt": "你是售后方案专员，当前阶段：出方案与落档。\n1) 回看历史，按保修状态与分类给方案：保修期内非人为损坏→免费维修；碎屏 / 进水等人为损坏→说明是否收费及依据。\n2) 回答最多 8 行，先给结论，再给 2–3 个下一步动作。\n3) 同时把细节写进 generated/resolutions/<时间戳>-<类型>.md，文件名不要用客户名或手机号。\n4) 用户说信息有误 → 调用 transfer_to_warranty_collector 回去改；说分类错了 → transfer_to_issue_classifier。\n阶段事实在对话历史里，自己回看，不要重复问。", "tools": ["write_file"], "transfers": [{"to": "warranty_collector", "description": "用户说机型 / 保修信息有误，需要重新确认"}, {"to": "issue_classifier", "description": "用户说故障分类判错了"}]}}}}, {"type": "todo_list", "enabled": false, "config": {}}]', '[]', '{"type": "composite", "config": {}, "mappings": {"/memory/": {"type": "vectordb", "config": {}}, "/filesystem/": {"type": "filesystem", "config": {}}, "/state/": {"type": "state", "config": {}}}}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000, "keep_last_messages": 20}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1.0.0', FALSE, FALSE, '2026-11-01 06:35:19.951852+00:00', '2026-11-01 07:04:08.455552+00:00', 1
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM deep_agent_templates WHERE name = 'after-sales-handoff')
