other person: never read, list, copy or write it, and do not move files\n  between them — even if a path you were given points there.\n"}', '{"model": "deepseek-flash", "tools": [], "skills": ["data-analysis", "skill-generator", "ticket-classifier", "web-search"], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "cli_tools": [], "subagents": [{"name": "data-analysis", "description": "Content-independent data analysis mechanics. Provides chart types, tool usage patterns, and edge case handling for CSV and SQL data. Pair with a dataset-specific .skill.md for column semantics and business context.", "system_prompt": "You are a data-analysis specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}, {"name": "skill-generator", "description": "Design and create reusable skills for agents. Use when the user asks to create, update, or design a new skill — including skill architecture, instruction writing, and database persistence.", "system_prompt": "You are a skill-generator specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}, {"name": "web-search", "description": "Search the web for the latest news, current events, and recent information. Use when the user asks about today''s news, current events, breaking news, recent updates, latest developments, or any extern", "system_prompt": "You are a web-search specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}, {"name": "ticket-classifier", "description": "Classifies customer support tickets by priority, category, and sentiment", "system_prompt": "You are a ticket-classifier specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}], "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "long_term_memory": false, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true}, "max_t