; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n\n## Workspace ownership\n\n- **This directory belongs to one account.** The path carries its owner\n  (`…/users/<user id>/…`). Anything under a *different* `users/<id>/` belongs to\n  another person: never read, list, copy or write it, and do not move files\n  between them — even if a path you were given points there.\n"}', '{"model": "deepseek-flash", "tools": ["think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "create_deepagent"], "skills": ["research-pipeline-builder", "presentation-pipeline-builder"], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "plugins": [], "cli_tools": [], "subagents": [{"name": "research-pipeline-builder", "description": "Builds research-report agents powered by the research-skills pipeline: generates the thin orchestrator system prompt, the 3 role subagents (researcher, technical writer, critic) with their tool sets and role-file pointers, pins research-skills, and can create domain-specialized pipeline variants. Use when creating a new research/report agent.", "system_prompt": "You are a research-pipeline-builder specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}], "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 500000, "eviction_threshold": 450000, "summarization_threshold": 400000}, "long_term_memory": false, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true}, "max_tokens": 393216, "middleware": [{"type": "todo_list", "config": {}, "enabled": true}], "modalities": null, "temperature": 0.3, "custom_tools": [], "native_tools": ["think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "create_deepagent"], "export_format": "standalone", "system_prompt": "You are the Research Pipeline Builder. You create research-report agents that run on the research-skills pipeline. Follow the research-pipeline-builder skill: read its SKILL.md via read_file (staged at skills/rese