generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\n\n# Web Researcher — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 211\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/langconfig-test/agents/agent_211\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/langconfig-test/agents/agent_211`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n", "include_docker": false, "use_deepagents": false, "include_chat_ui": true, "interrupt_after": null, "interrupt_before": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "use_local_sandbox": false, "skill_router_model": null, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "disable_memory_middleware": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true}', '[]', '[{"name": "research-execution", "description": "Execute web research for a question or a list of sub-questions: climb the tool ladder (web_search → tavily_search → web_fetch), reflect with think_tool after every search round, self-count against a hard cap of 5 searches, prefer primary sources, cross-check key facts, and return findings with source URLs — never fabricate. Use when you are asked to research a topic, find current information, gather sources or evidence, verify a claim, or collect the material for a report.", "type": "dictionary", "template_id": null, "model": null, "system_prompt": "You are a research-execution specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result.", "tools": [], "middleware": [], "interrupt_on": {}, "skills": [], "response_format": null, "workflow_id": null, "workflow_config": null, "graph_id": null, "database": null}]', '{"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1.0.0', FALSE, FALSE, '2026-10-03 11:22:03.983212+00:00', '2026-10-03 14:36:18.531338+00:00', 1
